      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the same adult man depicted in all six views of <Picture 1>. The large frontal portrait defines his facial identity. The smaller views define his profile, body proportions and clothing. All views depict ONE person with black swept-up hair, a trimmed black beard, a peach T-shirt and a black watch on his left wrist.\n\nsummary:\nOne continuous photorealistic studio portrait shot of <Subject 1>, tight close-up studio portrait framed from the chest and shoulders upward, face filling most of the frame, with his face prominently visible.\n\nretention_analysis:\nPreserve the facial proportions, eyes, nose, lips, skin tone, hairline, black hairstyle and beard of <Subject 1>. Retain his clothing and watch. Use the sheet only as a character reference. Do not reproduce its panels, white dividers, collage layout or multiple figures.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] A static eye-level camera frames <Subject 1> from the waist upward against a seamless light-gray studio background. His head and face are large enough in the frame to show clear eyes, eyebrows, individual beard hairs and natural skin texture. Soft neutral lighting illuminates his face evenly. He looks toward the camera with a calm expression, breathes gently and blinks once. He slowly turns his head a small amount to his left, then returns to face the camera. His facial identity remains consistent throughout. Natural subtle movement, one person, one uninterrupted shot, no cuts, no zoom and no text.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet indoor room ambience. No speech.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
